SUMMARY:A Gentleman's Guide to Love and Murder at UWF
LOCATION:Besser Studio Theatre\, UWF Center for Fine and Performing Arts\, 
 Building 82\, Campus Drive\, Pensacola\, FL 32514
DESCRIPTION:Fri 11/6\, Sat 11/7\, Fri 11/13\, Sat 11/14 at 7:30 PM · Sun 1
 1/8 and Sun 11/15 at 2:30 PM\n\nUWF Theatre stages the Tony-winning musica
 l comedy about a poor young man who plots his way past the relatives ahead
  of him in line for an earldom. There are four evening shows at 7:30 PM an
 d two Sunday matinees at 2:30 PM. UWF says adult situations and subject ma
 tter may make the show inappropriate for some audiences.\n\nPrice: No publ
 ished price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-uwf-gentlem
 ans-guide-1106.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-uwf-gentlemans-guide-1106.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
