SUMMARY:Make Your Own Glass (hot glass\, by appointment)
LOCATION:First City Art Center\, 1060 N Guillemard St\, Pensacola\, FL 3250
 1
DESCRIPTION:By appointment: Wednesdays 5 PM-9 PM\, Saturdays 8 AM-11 AM\n\n
 Make Your Own Glass is a hands-on hot glass session at First City Art Cent
 er in Pensacola\, where each participant makes a piece with a glassblower.
  It's for ages 8 and up including adults\, by appointment on Wednesdays fr
 om 5-9 PM and Saturdays from 8-11 AM. The finished piece cools in an annea
 ling oven and is picked up the following week. Standard pieces cost $85\, 
 and premium pieces such as a pumpkin\, ornament\, cup or bowl cost $110-$1
 40.\n\nPrice: from $85\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-
 make-your-own-glass-hot-glass-by-a-1007.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-make-your-own-glass-hot-glass-by
 -a-1007.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
