SUMMARY:Moonlight Garden photography exhibition by Mark Alan Francis
LOCATION:Switzer Gallery\, Pensacola State College\, 1000 College Blvd.\, B
 ldg. 15\, Pensacola\, FL 32504
DESCRIPTION:Through Friday 12/11 · Weekdays\n\nMark Alan Francis shows lan
 dscape photographs made with the Mordançage process\, which leaves copper
 \, tan and burnt sienna tones in black-and-white silver gelatin prints. Th
 e prints look as if they were shot at night under moonlight. The show hang
 s in the Switzer Gallery from November 5 through December 11.\n\nPrice: No
  published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-psc-mo
 onlight-garden-photography-1105.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-psc-moonlight-garden-photography
 -1105.html
