SUMMARY:Gateway: From Graffiti to Gallery at the Mobile Museum of Art
LOCATION:Mobile Museum of Art\, 4850 Museum Dr\, Mobile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday to Saturday · 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM\, through 9/1/2027\n
 \nThe Mobile Museum of Art traces how artists who started with graffiti in
  New York's subways moved into galleries\, with work by Basquiat\, Haring\
 , Scharf\, KAWS and Banksy from the Masterworks Foundation collection. The
  show runs a full year\, Tuesday through Saturday. Mobile County residents
  get in free on Thursdays.\n\nPrice: from $8\n\nDetails: https://coastalev
 entures.com/events/ev-mobile-museum-gateway-exhibition-0901.html
